[{"id":160701678,"discussion_id":"9deb4f0ac354f7b9310affbadcea3dbd3ca0381b","body":"\nThank your for your pull-request.\n\nThe full list of commands accepted by me can be found at [**here**](https://gitcode.com/cann/infrastructure/blob/main/docs/robot/robot%E4%BD%BF%E7%94%A8%E6%8C%87%E5%8D%97.md#-%E5%A6%82%E9%9C%80%E4%BA%86%E8%A7%A3%E8%AF%A6%E7%BB%86%E7%9A%84%E5%91%BD%E4%BB%A4%E5%8F%AF%E5%8F%82%E8%80%83%E4%B8%8B%E6%96%B9%E8%AF%A6%E7%BB%86%E8%A1%A8%E6%A0%BC).\n\nYou can get sig-info at [**here**](https://gitcode.com/cann/community/blob/master/CANN/sigs/ops-transformer/sig-info.yaml)\n","created_at":"2026-01-21T15:04:45+08:00","updated_at":"2026-01-21T15:04:45+08:00","user":{"id":"673c1552584fe8295cfd4a13","login":"cann-robot","object_id":"673c1552584fe8295cfd4a13","name":"CANN-robot","avatar_url":"https://cdn-img.gitcode.com/bf/ad/b7f29486a040d7b2f52bf6c78414692d7d585eb1ec628cea3eb01c9d63f68618.png?time=1755691472703","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/cann-robot"},"comment_type":"pr_comment"},{"id":160701686,"discussion_id":"d55d624bd26734e565dc8e7f4c56597deec4ff71","body":"以下是根据您提交的修改文件推荐的Reviewer和Committer序列，需各模块评审通过后方可合入\n| Module List | Reviewers | Committers |\n|-------|-------|-------|\n| attention     | [*mabing1118*](https://gitcode.com/mabing1118), [*yang-binrong*](https://gitcode.com/yang-binrong), [*gaoxiang618*](https://gitcode.com/gaoxiang618), [*yu-xinjie62*](https://gitcode.com/yu-xinjie62), [*crystalhu*](https://gitcode.com/crystalhu)    | [*monologue815*](https://gitcode.com/monologue815), [*mabing1118*](https://gitcode.com/mabing1118)    |\n","created_at":"2026-01-21T15:04:46+08:00","updated_at":"2026-01-21T15:04:46+08:00","user":{"id":"673c1552584fe8295cfd4a13","login":"cann-robot","object_id":"673c1552584fe8295cfd4a13","name":"CANN-robot","avatar_url":"https://cdn-img.gitcode.com/bf/ad/b7f29486a040d7b2f52bf6c78414692d7d585eb1ec628cea3eb01c9d63f68618.png?time=1755691472703","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/cann-robot"},"comment_type":"pr_comment"},{"id":160701720,"discussion_id":"bab2f6292b231fb2c7e889ee7a51663350d3ad54","body":"### CLA Signature Pass  \n ansen-changan, thanks for your pull request. All authors of the commits have signed the CLA. :+1: ","created_at":"2026-01-21T15:04:51+08:00","updated_at":"2026-01-21T15:04:51+08:00","user":{"id":"673c1552584fe8295cfd4a13","login":"cann-robot","object_id":"673c1552584fe8295cfd4a13","name":"CANN-robot","avatar_url":"https://cdn-img.gitcode.com/bf/ad/b7f29486a040d7b2f52bf6c78414692d7d585eb1ec628cea3eb01c9d63f68618.png?time=1755691472703","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/cann-robot"},"comment_type":"pr_comment"},{"id":160701734,"discussion_id":"8680b1d2459dd562d0b7f877a859f36a6db81bd2","body":":large_blue_circle: source code change are detected, tasks labels is removed in this pull request!","created_at":"2026-01-21T15:04:53+08:00","updated_at":"2026-01-21T15:04:53+08:00","user":{"id":"673c1552584fe8295cfd4a13","login":"cann-robot","object_id":"673c1552584fe8295cfd4a13","name":"CANN-robot","avatar_url":"https://cdn-img.gitcode.com/bf/ad/b7f29486a040d7b2f52bf6c78414692d7d585eb1ec628cea3eb01c9d63f68618.png?time=1755691472703","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/cann-robot"},"comment_type":"pr_comment"},{"id":160702108,"discussion_id":"6cb5d4fc7e5530334b7534b5d10bf3bf9dbe24d8","body":"## 问题/功能描述\n\n本次PR主要针对FlashAttention反向传播算子中Sinkhorn注意力机制（`sink == 1`）的实现进行了一系列优化和修复。核心解决了三个问题：1）工作空间内存分配逻辑存在重复计算和冗余，可能导致内存分配不准确；2）梯度后处理中的数据拷贝填充策略不精确，影响计算正确性和性能；3）内核代码中存在工作空间初始化条件错误、缓冲区访问越界以及尾部数据未清零等缺陷，可能导致计算错误或程序崩溃。\n\n## 修改方案描述\n\n修改方案从内存管理、计算逻辑和内核执行三个层面进行了系统性的重构与修复。首先，将Sinkhorn相关的工作空间大小计算和偏移设置整合到条件判断块中，确保仅在功能启用时分配内存，消除了冗余。其次，优化了数据拷贝填充逻辑，动态决定是否填充，提升了内存带宽利用率。最后，在内核层面，修正了工作空间初始化逻辑，确保仅由指定核心执行一次以避免竞态和越界；同时调整了缓冲区初始化顺序，并对计算缓冲区的无效尾部区域进行显式清零，杜绝了数据污染风险，保障了Sinkhorn梯度计算的正确性和健壮性。","created_at":"2026-01-21T15:06:46+08:00","updated_at":"2026-01-21T15:06:46+08:00","user":{"id":"673c1552584fe8295cfd4a13","login":"cann-robot","object_id":"673c1552584fe8295cfd4a13","name":"CANN-robot","avatar_url":"https://cdn-img.gitcode.com/bf/ad/b7f29486a040d7b2f52bf6c78414692d7d585eb1ec628cea3eb01c9d63f68618.png?time=1755691472703","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/cann-robot"},"comment_type":"pr_comment"},{"id":160702121,"discussion_id":"5ff457e2ab58d441d3ab34f5d64182efa707c6dd","body":"### 代码可维护性: 在GetWorkspaceSize、DoPreTiling和DoPostTiling三个函数中，计算s1Pad和s2Pad的代码重复出现。这违反了DRY（Don't Repeat Yourself）原则，增加了维护成本。\n\n**问题类型**: 代码可维护性\n**文件路径**: `attention/flash_attention_score_grad/op_host/arch32/flash_attention_score_grad_tiling_s1s2_bn2gs1s2_sab.cpp`\n**行号**: 711\n**问题代码**:\n```cpp\nsize_t s1Pad = (fBaseParams.s1 + 255) / 256 * 256;\nsize_t s2Pad = (fBaseParams.s2 + 255) / 256 * 256;\n```\n**修改建议**:\n```\n将计算s1Pad和s2Pad的逻辑提取为一个辅助函数，例如：std::pair<size_t, size_t> CalculatePaddedSizes(int64_t s1, int64_t s2) { return {(s1 + 255) / 256 * 256, (s2 + 255) / 256 * 256}; }，然后在三个函数中调用该辅助函数。\n```\n\n---\n*此评论由代码审查工具自动生成*","created_at":"2026-01-21T15:06:50+08:00","updated_at":"2026-01-21T15:51:12+08:00","user":{"id":"673c1552584fe8295cfd4a13","login":"cann-robot","object_id":"673c1552584fe8295cfd4a13","name":"CANN-robot","avatar_url":"https://cdn-img.gitcode.com/bf/ad/b7f29486a040d7b2f52bf6c78414692d7d585eb1ec628cea3eb01c9d63f68618.png?time=1755691472703","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/cann-robot"},"comment_type":"diff_comment","resolved":true,"resolved_by":{"id":"68848dafdea8931fab644b30","login":"ansen-changan","object_id":"68848dafdea8931fab644b30","name":"hid71829882","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/ansen-changan"},"diff_position":{"start_new_line":711,"end_new_line":711,"start_old_line":711,"end_old_line":711,"position_type":"text"}},{"id":160702131,"discussion_id":"ab926052c6610adfddc800bff9318961d24bacac","body":"### 代码一致性: 在DoPreTiling函数中，sink相关的偏移计算逻辑与GetWorkspaceSize函数中的计算逻辑需要保持一致。修改后的代码在1862-1868行添加了sink offset计算，但需要确保这里使用的计算公式（特别是s1Pad和s2Pad的计算方式）与GetWorkspaceSize函数中的计算完全一致，以避免workspace分配和偏移计算不匹配的问题。\n\n**问题类型**: 代码一致性\n**文件路径**: `attention/flash_attention_score_grad/op_host/arch32/flash_attention_score_grad_tiling_s1s2_bn2gs1s2_sab.cpp`\n**行号**: 1113\n**问题代码**:\n```cpp\n    // sink offset\n    if (fBaseParams.sink == 1) {\n        size_t s1Pad = (fBaseParams.s1 + 255) / 256 * 256;\n        size_t s2Pad = (fBaseParams.s2 + 255) / 256 * 256;\n        dropBeginAddr = (dropBeginAddr + fBaseParams.b * fBaseParams.n2 *  fBaseParams.g * s1Pad * s2Pad / fBaseParams.baseMN * FP32_BYTES + GM_ALIGN) / GM_ALIGN * GM_ALIGN;\n        dropBeginAddr = (dropBeginAddr + sizeof(int32_t) + GM_ALIGN) / GM_ALIGN * GM_ALIGN;\n    }\n```\n**修改建议**:\n```\n验证DoPreTiling函数中的sink offset计算与GetWorkspaceSize函数中的workspace大小计算使用完全相同的公式。特别是s1Pad和s2Pad的计算方式、对齐方式（GM_ALIGN）以及乘以FP32_BYTES等细节都需要完全一致。建议将这两个计算提取为公共函数或宏定义，以确保一致性。\n```\n\n---\n*此评论由代码审查工具自动生成*","created_at":"2026-01-21T15:06:53+08:00","updated_at":"2026-01-21T17:47:46+08:00","user":{"id":"673c1552584fe8295cfd4a13","login":"cann-robot","object_id":"673c1552584fe8295cfd4a13","name":"CANN-robot","avatar_url":"https://cdn-img.gitcode.com/bf/ad/b7f29486a040d7b2f52bf6c78414692d7d585eb1ec628cea3eb01c9d63f68618.png?time=1755691472703","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/cann-robot"},"comment_type":"diff_comment","resolved":true,"resolved_by":{"id":"68848dafdea8931fab644b30","login":"ansen-changan","object_id":"68848dafdea8931fab644b30","name":"hid71829882","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/ansen-changan"},"diff_position":{"start_new_line":1113,"end_new_line":1113,"start_old_line":1113,"end_old_line":1113,"position_type":"text"}},{"id":160712322,"discussion_id":"8748859482414e55f07c08d55ba7f1e2b149e892","body":"compile","created_at":"2026-01-21T15:51:16+08:00","updated_at":"2026-01-21T15:51:16+08:00","user":{"id":"68848dafdea8931fab644b30","login":"ansen-changan","object_id":"68848dafdea8931fab644b30","name":"hid71829882","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/ansen-changan"},"comment_type":"pr_comment"},{"id":160712549,"discussion_id":"3bf89f2c6873344ffd0e812554a8412b96e72045","body":"流水线任务触发成功，任务链接 [<b><a href='https://www.openlibing.com/apps